{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"36ab37f47929460ac8928512eeffe033a3414e4172946dd43aba371b36992c9e","ja":"みんなでチョコレート研究","zh":"大家一起研究巧克力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6baba77d45aaa27df2e18d7e5f8a5d9fa5edb21dbbcd077c1bad29fb9f8f32ea","ja":"ミルクチョコレートは血糖値が急上昇するので、先に\n上昇を抑える食べ物を、口にしたほうがいいそうです。","zh":"牛奶巧克力会让血糖急剧上升，所以据说最好\n先吃一些能抑制血糖上升的食物。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"45a8d45bc7737be763ce2c4901ea563e47a67ebe1e3ce932068f5198dc042cec","ja":"それじゃあ、例えば……りんごなんてどうだい？","zh":"那么，比方说……苹果怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"356374a09d41c713b5ca95d6327b9291c321f9489c47a3075b21bb20ec45ebf8","ja":"あっ！　リンゴは血糖値上昇を抑えられるって\nネットに書いてる！　食べてみるね♪","zh":"啊！网上说苹果能抑制血糖上升呢！\n我吃吃看哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a2218aacb112e62da6a990b67a5a583d3bf52e90c649929829e23b3c8324e6d7","ja":"あとはやはり、食べる時間帯なども\n重要になってくるかと。","zh":"还有就是，进食的时间段等\n应该也会变得很重要。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d7d1444bf24ca5b1dfc6e991bdaf6e9af607381dd268a86f2fb4801875e2a3fb","ja":"寝る前に食べるのは、やめたほうがよさそうだよねぇ。","zh":"睡前还是不要吃东西比较好呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0399774afb16c6f9cdbc04182942839fcb2fa4a9fea100f754265bb414b0b9f0","ja":"はい。一番適している時間帯は……午後2～3時なら、\n体がカロリーをため込みにくいそうです。","zh":"好的。最合适的时间段是……据说如果是下午2～3点，\n身体就不太容易积攒热量。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"995e738723b468cc85840d7ea12e9fbf23439a343d440ad9f520017858a55842","ja":"なるほど……ふたりとも、ありがとうございます！\nおかげで、食べても大丈夫な気がしてきました♪","zh":"原来如此……谢谢你们两位！\n托你们的福，我感觉吃了应该也没问题了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"556d83c7980fa59cc3db74a2ab704190a6b95e4519dc668d2d8852dfc5ccfc74","ja":"私も、も～っとチョコレートのこと研究して、\nおいしく健康的に食べますねっ！","zh":"我也要更～深入地研究巧克力，\n吃得既美味又健康！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4b659ffae03267ee92c1cfe81ab9dfac11b4461107c5fe8366fe77174f812485","ja":"可奈ちゃん、最近調子がいいみたいだねぇ。\nダンスの先生も褒めてたよぉ。","zh":"可奈，最近状态好像很不错呢～。\n舞蹈老师也夸奖你了哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"5356dea601cbf36c376bc39a6dcbcb817521656803ede7c0e22d832d71ff79af","ja":"レッスンの前に、りんごを食べてからチョコを\n食べてるんだ！　そしたら集中力がアップしたかも♪","zh":"训练前我都会先吃苹果再吃\n巧克力！感觉注意力都集中起来了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1661.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"55a4df9e335109407528b7ba778ad8baaa469c849260d3d2317dec2aee225dbf","ja":"チョコレートとの付き合い方が\n上手になったみたいですね。何よりです。","zh":"看来你已经变得更懂得\n如何对待巧克力了呢。真是太好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
